# Dashboard Asset Filters

The Modern Sleek dashboard (`FinancialDashboard2`) filters its Asset Performance Ledger with a controlled search field and All, Property, and Auto category pills.

- Keep search and category filtering combined so each result satisfies both controls.
- Preserve the rounded search field and pill-shaped category buttons.
- Use semantic theme tokens for control colors and maintain visible focus states in light and dark themes.
- Keep the controls stacked at the existing 1056px responsive breakpoint.
